  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to to mitigate an identified need to provide effective psychosocial treatment and legal support to victims of violence in local communities of Guatemala and Nicaragua. The participants of this exchange project provide psychosocial support to victims of violence, namely women, youth and children in schools and communities. The project also targets the individuals who commit the acts of violence, in an attempt to identify and treat the root causes of the violence.  Guatemala and Nicaragua</narrative>
  </description>
